ithub.com/insightitsGit/prism-eval">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>Context Bombs 探索阻止 AI 攻击者的方法</title><link>https://agentic.tracebit.com/context-bombs/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://agentic.tracebit.com/context-bombs/</guid><description>文章介绍了名为 Context Bombs 的方法，用于阻止 AI 攻击者。</description><source url="https://agentic.tracebit.com/context-bombs/">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>OpenCode 修复会话压缩与模型配置问题</title><link>https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v1.18.17</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v1.18.17</guid><description>v1.18.17 让会话压缩保留完整的近期轮次，并为较小模型生成更清晰的摘要；同时加入 MERGE Gateway 推理变体。</description><source url="https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v1.18.17">GitHub Release: anomalyco/opencode</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>llms.txt 在 83 个网站上的实际抓取次数有限</title><link>https://www.ezy.ai/research/do-ai-bots-read-llms-txt</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.ezy.ai/research/do-ai-bots-read-llms-txt</guid><description>该实验在 83 个网站部署 llms.txt，12 周内观察到 OpenAI 爬虫读取 7 次。</description><source url="https://www.ezy.ai/research/do-ai-bots-read-llms-txt">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>学习如何把 AI 治理落到实际流程</title><link>https://www.etherionconsulting.com/blog/what-is-ai-governance-and-how-to-operationalize-it/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.etherionconsulting.com/blog/what-is-ai-governance-and-how-to-operationalize-it/</guid><description>文章讨论 AI 治理的定义以及如何将其操作化。</description><source url="https://www.etherionconsulting.com/blog/what-is-ai-governance-and-how-to-operationalize-it/">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>理解企业 AI 代理采用中的默认配置问题</title><link>https://imphan.substack.com/p/the-wrong-defaults-an-ai-agent-manifesto</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://imphan.substack.com/p/the-wrong-defaults-an-ai-agent-manifesto</guid><description>文章提出错误的默认设置是企业 AI 代理采用失败的原因。</descripti